---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ikatan Alumni — Program Studi Sistem Informasi"
  description="Jejaring Ikatan Alumni Sistem Informasi Universitas Darwan Ali (IKA-SISFO UNDA). Kiprah lulusan, testimoni karier, dan kemitraan industri."
  lang="id"
>
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white border-b border-navy-800 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-navy-950 border border-navy-800 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-300 mb-4">
          <span>Jejaring Profesional Lulusan</span>
          <span class="text-slate-600">·</span>
          <span>IKA-SISFO UNDA</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold font-editorial tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
          Alumni & Jejaring Industri
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Sarjana Sistem Informasi Universitas Darwan Ali telah berkiprah luas sebagai System Analyst, Data Scientist, IT Project Administrator, Software Engineer, ASN, dan wirausahawan digital di berbagai pelosok Kalimantan Tengah dan nasional.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-16">
    
    {/* Testimoni Alumni */}
    <section>
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4 mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-600 block">Kisah Sukses Lulusan</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 font-editorial">
          Testimoni & Pengalaman Berkarier
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="card-academic p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
              "Kurikulum kurasi praktikum di SISFO UNDA sangat relevan dengan kebutuhan industri perkebunan kelapa sawit modern. Pemahaman ERP dan database management menjadi modal utama saya dalam mengelola sistem rantai pasok perusahaan."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-gold-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center font-editorial">
              R
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900">Rian Pratama, S.Kom.</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">ERP Specialist — PT Sinarmas Agro</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-academic p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
              "Bimbingan riset skripsi di bidang Machine Learning dan Computer Vision membuka pintu karir saya sebagai Associate Data Scientist. Dosen-dosen selalu mendorong kami berani bersaing dan mempublikasikan karya nyata."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-gold-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center font-editorial">
              S
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900">Siti Nurhaliza, S.Kom.</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Junior Data Scientist — Tech Startup Jakarta</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-academic p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
              "Kemampuan analisis proses bisnis (BPMN) dan tata kelola TI memudahkan saya memimpin transformasi digital pelayanan publik di Dinas Komunikasi dan Informatika daerah."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-gold-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center font-editorial">
              A
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900">Ahmad Fadillah, S.Kom.</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Pranata Komputer Ahli Pertama — Diskominfo</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Tracer Study CTA Banner */}
    <section class="card-academic p-8 sm:p-12 bg-navy-950 text-white border-navy-800 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-2 max-w-2xl text-center md:text-left">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400">Evaluasi Mutu Kurikulum</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-editorial text-white">
          Bantu Kami Meningkatkan Mutu Pendidikan Melalui Tracer Study
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Setiap masukan dan riwayat penyerapan kerja alumni sangat berharga bagi evaluasi kurikulum OBE dan akreditasi prodi di masa mendatang.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/tracer-study/"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap transition-colors"
      >
        Isi Kuesioner Tracer Study →
      </a>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
